            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the follow up.\n\n> Here you can see that after deleting the buffer you can see that the buffer is still listed but has been deleted and only the icon is missing.\n\nYes, this is expected. The item list did not change, so the item is present. But the icon is computed based on the buffer id, which is for the absent buffer (hence no icon).\n\nThe documentation is deliberately concise to show the direction. If this to be improved, it is only by adding custom picker-local mapping. But not yet sure about whether this is a good idea, so let's leave this issue open until now.",
